cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this dataset, please cite it as below."
title: "RoCarp-CHM-AGB: canopy height and aboveground biomass of the Romanian Carpathian forests at 10 m"
abstract: >-
  Wall-to-wall 10 m maps of forest canopy height and aboveground biomass across
  the Romanian Carpathian arc, produced by machine-learning models calibrated
  against NASA GEDI spaceborne LiDAR and applied to a multi-source predictor
  stack of Sentinel-1, Sentinel-2, ALOS-2 PALSAR-2 and terrain data. The CatBoost
  product carries a per-pixel predictive uncertainty layer estimated by the model.
type: dataset
version: "0.1.0-pre"
license: CC-BY-4.0
url: "https://GITHUB-USER.github.io/rocarp-chm-agb/"
repository-code: "https://github.com/GITHUB-USER/rocarp-chm-agb"
keywords:
